data: {"id": "c9df4cc488a94086-final", "run_id": "c9df4cc488a94086", "seq": 1239, "ts_ms": 1788781890462, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx (aiops-case-05) 卡在 ContainerCreating 阶段，Pod Phase 为 Pending。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod `workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` 状态：`ContainerCreating` | 确认应用容器未被调度启动，处于等待资源阶段 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Multus | `NoNetworkFound`: cannot find a network-attachment-definition (unavailable-network) in namespace (aiops-case-05) (持续约 60m, 频率高) | 核心证据，直接指出依赖的网络定义资源不存在 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubelet | `FailedCreatePodSandBox`: plugin type=\"multus\" name=\"multus-cni-network\" failed (add) ... cannot find a network-attachment-definition ... not found | 确认底层沙箱创建因网络插件报错而失败 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` = 1 (labels: `container=\"app\"`, `reason=\"ContainerCreating\"`) | 监控数据与事件状态一致，量化了等待现象的持续性 |\n\n**证据关联说明：**\nKubernetes 事件（#2, #3）在时间线上连续记录了多分钟，指出 Multus 插件找不到 `unavailable-network` 定义，直接导致 Kubelet 无法创建沙箱；Kubernetes 状态（#1）和指标（#4）则从宏观层面证实了该 Pod 因此一直处于等待状态，未发生资源争用等其他问题。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod 注解引用不存在的网络定义 -> Multus CNI 报错 NoNetworkFound -> Kubelet 无法创建 Pod 沙箱 (FailedCreatePodSandBox) -> Pod 持续处于 ContainerCreating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认根因：** Pod `workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx` 的注解中引用的 NetworkAttachmentDefinition 资源 `unavailable-network` 在命名空间 `aiops-case-05` 中不存在。\n\n*   **机制：** Multus CNI 插件在尝试为 Pod 配置网络时，找不到对应的 `NetworkAttachmentDefinition` CRD 对象，导致沙箱创建失败。\n*   **证据支撑：** 这一结论由 Kubernetes Event 中的 `NoNetworkFound` 和 `FailedCreatePodSandBox` 错误原文直接证实（证据 #2, #3），并由 Metrics 中的等待状态作为辅助印证（证据 #4）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 51.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx: 51.6s (Evidence 43.2s, RCA 8.2s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-05/workload-5dbb5dcd6c-kbwsx**: pod-volume-mount-failed, pod-imagepull-failed, pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 77.747, "metrics": {"run_id": "c9df4cc488a94086", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 77.75376009941101, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error, pod-imagepull-failed, pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 77753.76009941101, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 59488.0530834198, "tool_calls": 12, "executed_tool_calls": 12, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 12, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duratio